WEBVTT

00:00:10.851 --> 00:00:12.548
[Sonic yelling][gasps]

00:00:14.463 --> 00:00:16.552
[strained panting]

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:19.120
Go ahead. Finish it!

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:23.168
What are you waiting for? Do it!

00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:25.910
[grunting]
I'm right here!

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:29.217
You didn't let your pain
change who you are...

00:00:30.653 --> 00:00:31.698
in here.

00:00:33.787 --> 00:00:35.571
[whimpering sigh]

00:00:40.141 --> 00:00:42.100
This is not who I am.

00:00:42.796 --> 00:00:44.450
What are you doing?

00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:47.496
You won. Take your revenge.

00:00:49.368 --> 00:00:51.500
There are no winners
with revenge.

00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:06.559
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.169
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.

00:01:09.649 --> 00:01:11.259
<i>They're like diamonds.</i>

00:01:13.522 --> 00:01:16.874
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...

00:01:18.876 --> 00:01:20.442
I was with her.

00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:24.533
I've felt this pain for so long.

00:01:26.231 --> 00:01:27.928
It's all I know.

00:01:28.102 --> 00:01:30.322
When I lost Longclaw...

00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:32.193
I felt the same way.

00:01:33.978 --> 00:01:36.415
Did your pain eventually
go away?

00:01:36.589 --> 00:01:38.547
No.

00:01:38.721 --> 00:01:40.636
But in time,
I learned there's something

00:01:40.811 --> 00:01:43.117
even more powerful than pain.

00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:45.380
The love we felt for each other.

00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:48.427
That's what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:50.821
Maria might be gone,

00:01:50.995 --> 00:01:52.997
but your love
will always remain.

00:02:07.663 --> 00:02:11.667
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."

00:02:16.759 --> 00:02:18.674
[cannon rumbling in distance]

00:02:23.505 --> 00:02:25.420
This whole mess
is my fault.

00:02:25.594 --> 00:02:28.423
I've been so blinded by rage,
I thought...

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.904
I had no choice.

00:02:34.429 --> 00:02:36.823
You always have a choice.

00:02:41.784 --> 00:02:44.526
But making the right one
is never easy.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.398
One more thing I learned

00:02:46.572 --> 00:02:49.357
is that when you
really screw something up,

00:02:49.531 --> 00:02:51.011
you can't fix it
on your own.

00:02:51.185 --> 00:02:53.405
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.854
Gotta go fast.

00:03:08.028 --> 00:03:10.378
Don't tell me you've
got a catchphrase.

00:03:10.552 --> 00:03:13.904
That's right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.

00:03:29.658 --> 00:03:32.835
I... will... not... try...[grunting]

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:35.969
...to stop... my...
elders... from...

00:03:36.143 --> 00:03:38.537
destroying... the... world!

00:03:39.364 --> 00:03:40.582
[screams]

00:03:44.195 --> 00:03:46.110
Playtime is over.

00:03:54.814 --> 00:03:57.034
There's no going back now.

00:03:57.208 --> 00:04:00.167
[wheezing grunts]

00:04:01.212 --> 00:04:03.562
Set up defense.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.826
Damn you, autocorrect!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.262
[attacking grunt]

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:12.005
[shouts]

00:04:12.701 --> 00:04:13.746
Mantis!

00:04:15.704 --> 00:04:16.967
Oh!

00:04:19.056 --> 00:04:20.187
[cackles]

00:04:20.361 --> 00:04:21.449
Whee!

00:04:22.233 --> 00:04:23.364
[hissing growl]

00:04:23.538 --> 00:04:26.150
I'm right here,
arach-nerd.

00:04:26.889 --> 00:04:27.716
[shouts]

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.632
[both grunting]

00:04:33.331 --> 00:04:36.464
[cackles]

00:04:36.638 --> 00:04:39.380
That's what I call
mantis-scaping.

00:04:39.554 --> 00:04:41.992
That's elder abuse!

00:04:45.604 --> 00:04:47.910
[exclaims]

00:04:48.085 --> 00:04:51.305
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>

00:04:51.479 --> 00:04:52.872
Shadow...

00:04:53.046 --> 00:04:55.657
I see you've chosen betrayal.

00:04:56.832 --> 00:04:59.487
And you were once
so useful to me.

00:05:15.199 --> 00:05:17.375
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?

00:05:17.549 --> 00:05:19.159
Just try to keep up.

